    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T21:59:53Z",
    "body": "Coordinator note. The two GPU research issues gave different homes for GPU compute code.\n\n- #2525 puts the nesting evaluator (#2615) in `camcraft-ui`, with no new crate.\n- #2526 puts GPU compute in a new `camcraft-gpu` crate (#2620), so that the CLI, MCP and tests can use a windowless device.\n\nRecommendation: one home only. If #2620 merges first, #2615 puts its evaluator in `camcraft-gpu` and uses the device policy and the CPU fallback rule of that crate. If #2615 is worked first, its worker reads #2620 and records the choice in its decision entry. The new crate and its direct `wgpu` dependency wait for the decision of the owner at review (`needs-maintainer`).\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
